{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24596","headline":"北窗竹石 · 白居易","name":"北窗竹石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一片瑟瑟石，数竿青青竹。\n向我如有情，依然看不足。\n况临北窗下，复近西塘曲。\n筠风散余清，苔雨含微绿。\n有妻亦衰老，无子方茕独。\n莫掩夜窗扉，共渠相伴宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}